<p>Apple Mail - highlight a part of an email, and it shows up in your reply. Email threads are sorted by chronological order.</p>
<p>Outlook - Highlighting does nothing. Copy-paste automatically defaults to the original fonts and style, not that of the email. Email threads (&ldquo;conversations&rdquo;) have two timelines in one: chronological and reverse-chronological.</p>
<p>I&rsquo;m starting to think they have a position for &ldquo;torturer&rdquo; they hire for now and then.</p>
